'''Bronze''' is a crafting material crafted by processing two [[Copper]] and one [[Tin]] at the [[Forge]]. Bronze can also be obtained by destroying the [[Standing Brazier]]s found in [[Frost Caves]] within the [[Mountain]] biome, or by destroying [[Ancient Pot]]s found in ruins and [[Putrid Hole]]s within the [[Ashlands]] biome. Additionally, Bronze can also be obtained by directly smelting the uncommon [[Scrap Bronze]] in a [[Smelter]].

